From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:36:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] regulator: apple-pmic-touch: Add Angel touch analog supply
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The iPad 5 N1 touchscreen takes its analog supply from the Angel PMIC
(D2365) function pmuL(0x21f). In iOS that is LDO index 31 with options 2
(enable only, no voltage programming), and its table entry switches
register 0x31c bit 0 through the PMIC's register map (iOS
0xfffffff006bbe488, 0xfffffff006bbe388, 0xfffffff006bbcdd8).

Add it as match data. The register and bit come from the iOS PMIC
driver only; the ADT names the function, not the register.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 28c4b7e3 (J71t ledger 8.8); his separate
 apple-d2365-touch driver becomes match data of Paul Praschl's PMIC
 touch regulator driver. Register 0x31c bit 0 is his value and still
 unconfirmed by the ADT.]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c    | 21 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c b/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c
index 75cae4a84..b7dafb33a 100644
--- a/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/apple-pmic-touch-regulator.c
@@ -32,6 +32,23 @@ static const struct regulator_desc apple_adelyn_touch_core = {
 	.off_on_delay = 1000,
 };
 
+/*
+ * Angel (D2365, iPad 5) pmuL(0x21f): LDO index 31, enable-only, through
+ * register 0x31c bit 0 (iOS 0xfffffff006bbe488, 0xfffffff006bbe388,
+ * 0xfffffff006bbcdd8). The ADT names only the function, so the register
+ * and bit are not yet confirmed by a second source.
+ */
+static const struct regulator_desc apple_angel_touch_analog = {
+	.name = "angel-touch-analog",
+	.ops = &apple_pmic_touch_regulator_ops,
+	.type = REGULATOR_VOLTAGE,
+	.owner = THIS_MODULE,
+	.enable_reg = 0x31c,
+	.enable_mask = 0x01,
+	.enable_val = 0x01,
+	.disable_val = 0,
+};
+
 static const struct regulator_desc apple_chestnut_touch_hv = {
 	.name = "chestnut-touch-hv",
 	.ops = &apple_pmic_touch_regulator_ops,
@@ -76,6 +93,10 @@ static const struct of_device_id apple_pmic_touch_regulator_of_match[] = {
 		.compatible = "apple,adelyn-touch-core-regulator",
 		.data = &apple_adelyn_touch_core,
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible = "apple,angel-touch-analog-regulator",
+		.data = &apple_angel_touch_analog,
+	},
 	{
 		.compatible = "apple,chestnut-touch-hv-regulator",
 		.data = &apple_chestnut_touch_hv,
